<section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 border-t border-white/5">
    <div class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4">Pro-Drifter Strategy</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-400 max-w-2xl">Mastering the web requires more than just watching anime. It requires understanding the architecture of the Japanese animation industry.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-slate-900/50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-indigo-500/30 transition-all">
            <h4 class="text-indigo-400 font-bold mb-2 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest">Tip 01</h4>
            <h3 class="text-white font-bold mb-3 italic text-lg">Identify "Bridge" Nodes</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Legendary Voice Actors like <strong>Mamoru Miyano</strong> or <strong>Yuki Kaji</strong> have hundreds of roles. They are the most common "hubs" used to jump between completely different genres.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-900/50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-emerald-500/30 transition-all">
            <h4 class="text-emerald-400 font-bold mb-2 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest">Tip 02</h4>
            <h3 class="text-white font-bold mb-3 italic text-lg">The Studio Ancestry</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Stuck? Remember that many studios are offshoots of others. Looking for a path from <strong>Gainax</strong> to <strong>Trigger</strong>? The connections are almost always through specific key animators or producers.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-900/50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-cyan-500/30 transition-all">
            <h4 class="text-cyan-400 font-bold mb-2 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest">Tip 03</h4>
            <h3 class="text-white font-bold mb-3 italic text-lg">Avoid the "Sink" Nodes</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Beware of niche characters who only appear in one OVA. They are "Sink Nodes"—dead ends in the graph that will waste your time and kill your speedrun.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-900/50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 hover:border-rose-500/30 transition-all">
            <h4 class="text-rose-400 font-bold mb-2 uppercase text-xs tracking-widest">Tip 04</h4>
            <h3 class="text-white font-bold mb-3 italic text-lg">Look for Shared Staff</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Director <strong>Shinichirō Watanabe</strong> often works with the same composers and studios. If you see a Bebop node, a Samurai Champloo connection is likely nearby.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>